  "notes": "ALP-photon oscillation limit from Crab Nebula sub-PeV gamma-rays (Tibet ASgamma + HAWC + MAGIC + HEGRA). Strongest 95% C.L. limit g_agamma < 1.8e-10 GeV^-1 for ALP mass 2e-7 to 6e-7 eV (Fig. 3). Text-quoted values used; full exclusion contour spans ~1e-9 to 1e-5 eV but only the strongest quoted point is reliably extractable. Paper also gives a dark photon DM kinetic mixing limit (eps < 1e-3 for m_D 0.01-1 eV, rho_DM=0.3 GeV/cm^3), but per hint the primary AxionPhoton result is reported here. | vector-trace candidate: dp_scatter.pdf colour (0.9, 0.62, 0.0), 122 pts (selected among 2) | selector: vector_trace over text (quality (1, 1, 1, 1, 3.5, 0, 0.85, 122))",
